<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Can an aesthetic clinic in Dubai ask patients for Google reviews?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Google's guidance says businesses can ask customers to leave a review by sharing a Google link or QR code. What is not allowed is offering anything in exchange for a review. Clinics should also check Dubai Health Authority (DHA) advertising guidance before reusing patient reviews in their own marketing."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can we offer a discount on the next treatment for a Google review?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Google classes free or discounted goods or services offered in exchange for reviews as fake and misleading content and strictly prohibits them. That covers reviews posted, changed or removed, so a reward for any of these puts the profile at risk."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How should a clinic reply to a Google review without breaching patient confidentiality?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Keep the reply general. Thank the reviewer, avoid naming the treatment, the practitioner's clinical decisions or anything that confirms they were a patient, and invite them to contact the clinic directly. Google also advises against sharing a reviewer's private information in a reply."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is it okay to only ask patients who seem happy to leave a review?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Google expects reviews to reflect genuine experiences, and sending only satisfied patients to your profile distorts that picture. Give every patient the same simple invitation and handle complaints through a private channel."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can a clinic repost patient Google reviews on Instagram or its website?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Be cautious. A review on Google is the patient's own content, but featuring it in your own advertising is a different matter and healthcare advertising is regulated. Check the current Dubai Health Authority (DHA) advertising rules, or ask the authority directly, before using patient reviews in promotional material."}}]}</script>

			
			
